  "html": "\u003Cdiv id=\u0022editbody1\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv dir=\u0022ltr\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022v1gmail_quote v1gmail_quote_container\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv style=\u0022font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #3b3b3b; background: #ffffff; margin: 0; width: 100%!important;\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ctable width=\u0022650\u0022 cellspacing=\u00220\u0022 align=\u0022center\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ctbody\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Ctd style=\u0022background-color: #ffffff;\u0022 width=\u0022100%\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://ind.millenniumbcp.pt/pt/negocios/PublishingImages/mail/2019/os_seus_documentos_11102019.jpg\u0022 alt=\u0022Os seus documentos sempre \u0026agrave; m\u0026atilde;o\u0022 width=\u0022650\u0022 height=\u0022496\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding: 30px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #3b3b3b; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.3em;\u0022\u003EEstimado(a) Cliente,\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003EEnviamos o documento em formato digital (.pdf): Documentos em formato digital do movimento feito na conta 45556587090 para que possa consultar de forma r\u0026aacute;pida e c\u0026oacute;moda.\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003ENo site, basta fazer login e ir a \u0022Opera\u0026ccedil;\u0026otilde;es Banc\u0026aacute;rias \u0026gt; Outros Servi\u0026ccedil;os \u0026gt; Documentos \u0026gt; Notas de Lan\u0026ccedil;amento\u0022 para ter acesso aos documentos emitidos nos \u0026uacute;ltimos 12 meses.\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003ECaso pretenda receb\u0026ecirc;-lo noutro email, aceda a \u0022Alertas \u0026gt; Notas de Lan\u0026ccedil;amento\u0022 e, na op\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o \u0022Criar Novo\u0022, indique o novo endere\u0026ccedil;o.\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\n\u003Ctable border=\u00220\u0022 width=\u0022100%\u0022 cellspacing=\u00220\u0022 cellpadding=\u00220\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ctbody\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Ctd style=\u0022font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 39px; line-height: 1.4em;\u0022 align=\u0022right\u0022 valign=\u0022top\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJ\u0026Aacute; CONHECE\u003Cbr /\u003EA \u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #d1005d;\u0022\u003E APP\u003Cbr /\u003EM EMPRESAS\u003C/span\u003E?\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding-left: 30px;\u0022 rowspan=\u00222\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://ind.millenniumbcp.pt/pt/negocios/PublishingImages/mail/2019/Informacao-da-sua-conta-tlm-11102019.jpg\u0022 alt=\u0022Telem\u0026oacute;vel\u0022 width=\u0022157\u0022 height=\u0022299\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Ctd style=\u0022font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.3em;\u0022 align=\u0022right\u0022 valign=\u0022top\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInstale j\u0026aacute; e fa\u0026ccedil;a a gest\u0026atilde;o da sua\u003Cbr /\u003EEmpresa a partir do smartphone.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #d1005d;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESimples, r\u0026aacute;pida e intuitiva!\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://ind.millenniumbcp.pt/pt/negocios/PublishingImages/mail/2019/inslacao-app-11102019.jpg\u0022 width=\u0022299\u0022 height=\u002247\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003C/tbody\u003E\n\u003C/table\u003E\n\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003ECom os melhores cumprimentos,\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022http://millenniumbcp.pt\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener noreferrer\u0022\u003Emillenniumbcp.pt\u003C/a\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Ctd style=\u0022font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; color: #3b3b3b; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 0px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://ind.millenniumbcp.pt/pt/Particulares/PublishingImages/mailimages/IT/M_barra_cinza_16072019.jpg\u0022 alt=\u0022M\u0022 width=\u0022630\u0022 height=\u002220\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Ctd style=\u0022font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; color: #3b3b3b; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px;\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ctable style=\u0022font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-style: normal; line-height: normal; font-weight: normal; color: #000000;\u0022 border=\u00220\u0022 width=\u0022100%\u0022 cellspacing=\u00220\u0022 cellpadding=\u00225\u0022 align=\u0022center\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ctbody\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding-right: 5px; color: #524e4b; text-align: left;\u0022 align=\u0022left\u0022 valign=\u0022top\u0022 width=\u002264%\u0022\u003EEste e-mail \u0026eacute; apenas informativo, n\u0026atilde;o responda a este endere\u0026ccedil;o. Estes e-mails n\u0026atilde;o permitem o acesso direto ao Site do Millennium bcp, n\u0026atilde;o incluem atalhos (links)* nem s\u0026atilde;o utilizados para solicitar quaisquer elementos identificativos ou c\u0026oacute;digos de acesso. Se n\u0026atilde;o pretende receber e-mails do tema em ep\u0026iacute;grafe, envie um e-mail para a caixa: \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:extratodigital.remover.campanhas@millenniumbcp.pt\u0022 rel=\u0022noreferrer\u0022\u003Eextratodigital.remover.campanhas@millenniumbcp.pt\u003C/a\u003E com o assunto \u0022Remover\u0022. Se n\u0026atilde;o pretende receber mais e-mails publicit\u0026aacute;rios do Millennium bcp, envie um e-mail para a caixa: \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:tudo.remover.campanhas@millenniumbcp.pt\u0022 rel=\u0022noreferrer\u0022\u003Etudo.remover.campanhas@millenniumbcp.pt\u003C/a\u003E com o assunto \u0022Remover tudo\u0022. Banco Comercial Portugu\u0026ecirc;s, S.A., registado no Banco de Portugal sob o n\u0026ordm;. 33; Sede: Pra\u0026ccedil;a D. Jo\u0026atilde;o I, 28, 4000-295 Porto; Capital Social: 3.000.000.000 euros; N\u0026uacute;mero \u0026uacute;nico de matr\u0026iacute;cula e de identifica\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o fiscal: 501525882 (Conservat\u0026oacute;ria do Registo Comercial do Porto).\u003Cbr /\u003E*Alguns servi\u0026ccedil;os de e-mail assumem, automaticamente, links em certas palavras, sem qualquer responsabilidade por parte do Millennium bcp.\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E91 850 45 04 \u0026bull; 93 050 45 04 \u0026bull; 96 150 41 26\u003C/strong\u003E (chamada para rede m\u0026oacute;vel nacional)\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u002B351 21 004 24 24\u003C/strong\u003E (chamada para rede fixa nacional)\u003Cbr /\u003EDispon\u0026iacute;vel todos os dias das 08h \u0026agrave;s 22h, hora de Portugal Continental.\u003Cbr /\u003EO custo das comunica\u0026ccedil;\u0026otilde;es depende do tarif\u0026aacute;rio acordado com o seu operador.\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003C/tbody\u003E\n\u003C/table\u003E\n\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003C/tbody\u003E\n\u003C/table\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv id=\u0022_rc_sig\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E",
